  "chain": "success-bias/lack of understanding [cause TBD] -> AO opens PT drawer during tag verification -> indicated low voltage on Unit 2 MFBs -> MFB supply breakers open -> Unit 2 MFBs de-energized (~22s) -> Keowee Hydroelectric Units 1&2 auto-start [backup KHS]",
